 ## NavAid pilots
 
-**Show public NavAid pilots** draws everyone sharing their position publicly (Share → **Public**),
-from the NavAid relay — not ADS-B. Works while you share publicly yourself, or on the secret
-viewing link. See [Follow me → Public share](Follow-Me#public-share-see-and-be-seen-by-every-navaid-pilot).
+One control, three choices, drawing everyone who shares their position publicly, from the NavAid
+relay — not ADS-B:
+
+- **Off** — nobody is shown, and your own aircraft is not public (a private Follow me link goes on).
+- **See others** — everyone shown, without sharing. Only on the secret viewing link; otherwise it is
+  dimmed, and a tap says to choose Share & see.
+- **Share & see** — you go public and see everyone, in one tap. Not sharing yet, it opens the usual
+  Follow me step (the identifier, then the link to hand round) with **Public** already ticked;
+  cancel there and nothing is left switched on. See [Follow me → Public share](Follow-Me#public-share-see-and-be-seen-by-every-navaid-pilot).
